  "notes": [
   "Merged band (direct coupling + surface reflection) stays one event at every height 0.05-0.15 m (one envelope maximum above 20 % in 0-10 ns on every library trace and every model trace)",
   "The merged band peak moves only 2.41 ns/m with antenna height (36 % of 2/c = 6.67 ns/m), and saturates near 0.15 m (3.0689 ns at 0.05 m, 3.2929 at 0.14 m, 3.2989 at 0.15 m). The isolated surface reflection (Z_REF_H - Z_FS_H) moves 5.61 ns/m (84 %). expected_band_shift_ns is the geometric 2(h_j - mean h)/c required by the spec; measured per-trace band peaks are in expected_band_peak_ns. Measured minus geometric shift: Z_HSTEP rms 0.170 ns, Z_HWAVE rms 0.158 ns (max 0.235 ns)",
   "Consequence for the spec 4-5 prediction (EM judgement, noise-free, not a harness result): the band moves 0.194 ns (Z_HSTEP) and 0.230 ns (Z_HWAVE) between the two pipe sides while the pipe apices move 0.523 ns and 0.652 ns (pilot 15.309 / 15.828 and 15.245 / 15.893 ns). With a band-peak zero the cur depth difference is about v * (0.523 - 0.194) / 2 = 1.6 cm (Z_HSTEP) and v * (0.652 - 0.230) / 2 = 2.1 cm (Z_HWAVE), smaller than the 2.7 / 3.3 cm in spec 4-1; the band-shift spread sigma_s would be roughly 0.1 ns rather than 0.24-0.27 ns. This is the case spec 4-5 describes (band merged with direct coupling moves less). The harness pilot (spec 4-4) decides; heights were not changed",
   "Per-trace geometry check: the first 9 ns of every model trace equals the library background of the same height to 4.3e-6 / 5.0e-6 (relative), and every receiver y equals 2.1 + h_j",
   "Free space: Z_FS_H traces at h 0.05 and 0.15 differ by 2.1e-6 relative, so one FS height would do; the library is kept for symmetry",
   "Late time: the largest |Ez| after 50 ns is a third-order pipe-surface multiple near the low-gap pipe (Z_HSTEP x 1.18, 50.7 ns) and far-pipe primary wings that reach the line ends at 52-55 ns; last-ns rises occur on 15/19 traces at those positions only (arrivals), not as growth on all traces",
   "Run cost: per-trace model (re-parse, no --geometry-fixed) took 10.7 min (Z_HSTEP) and 10.2 min (Z_HWAVE) for 161 traces (about 4.0 s per trace), libraries 1.5 min each"
  ]
